  "bodyHash": "4f9303b78715b712",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>FTB JEI 額外功能</h1>\n<p>JEI 額外功能是一款小型模組，旨在彌合其他模組與 JEI 之間的落差，特別是那些尚未提供 JEI 外掛程式，或僅提供基礎版外掛程式的模組。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>以下功能資訊基於 <code>1.21.1</code> 版本，隨著模組更新並新增或移除對 JEI 的支援，相關功能可能會有所調整。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>ExtendedAE</code></a> - 為 ExtendedAE 新增 JEI 支援。目前 ExtendedAE 僅內建支援 <code>EMI</code> 與 <code>REI</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>AdvancedAE</code></a> - 為 AdvancedAE 新增 JEI 支援。目前 AdvancedAE 僅內建支援 <code>EMI</code> 與 <code>REI</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>只要安裝了上述任一受支援的模組，本模組即可正常運作，因為各個外掛程式皆會以條件式方式進行註冊。</p>\n<h2>問題回報</h2>\n<p>如遇任何問題，請至我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤頁面</a> 進行回報。</p>\n<h2>功能請求</h2>\n<p>若您希望本模組支援其他額外模組，請在我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤頁面</a> 提交新議題，我們將盡快檢視。</p>\n<h2>技術支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>針對 <strong>整合包 (Modpack)</strong> 問題，請前往： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>針對 <strong>單一模組</strong> 問題，請前往： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>僅有疑問？歡迎加入我們的 Discord： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持關注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
